# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the Android app
# THE SIGNING KEY AND ITS PASSWORDS ARE PERMANENT AND SECRET. The key on the first published
# APK is the key on every future one -- a different key and Android refuses the update on every
# handset. It is kept OUTSIDE this repository; these lines are the second lock, for the day
# somebody drops a copy in here and runs `git add -A`.
android/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

